  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following postfix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`5 3 + 4 2 - * 7 1 / + 9 + 8 /`",
        "zh": "如果所有数都是一位数字,请计算以下后缀表达式:\n\n`5 3 + 4 2 - * 7 1 / + 9 + 8 /`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "12",
            "zh": "12"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "16",
            "zh": "16"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\n`5 3 + 4 2 - * 7 1 / + 9 + 8 /`\n\n= ((5 + 3) * (4 − 2) + (7 / 1) + 9) / 8 = (8 * 2 + 7 + 9) / 8 = (16 + 16) / 8 = 32 / 8 = 4",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n后缀表达式从左向右扫描。读到数字就入栈，遇到运算符先弹右操作数，再弹左操作数。先算 $5+3=8$ 和 $4-2=2$，相乘得 16。然后加上 $7/1=7$ 和 9 得 32，最后 $32/8=4$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following prefix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`- + / 6 3 ^ * 7 1 2 / + + 8 9 4 7`",
        "zh": "如果所有数都是一位数字,请计算以下前缀表达式:\n\n`- + / 6 3 ^ * 7 1 2 / + + 8 9 4 7`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "22",
            "zh": "22"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "48",
            "zh": "48"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "59",
            "zh": "59"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "77",
            "zh": "77"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nEach prefix operator takes its next two complete subexpressions as operands. For the outer subtraction, the left side is $6/3+(7\\cdot1)^2=2+49=51$. The right side is $((8+9)+4)/7=21/7=3$. Subtract right from left to get 48.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n每个前缀运算符后面紧跟两个完整子式。最外层减法的左侧为 $6/3+(7\\cdot1)^2=2+49=51$，右侧为 $((8+9)+4)/7=21/7=3$。左减右得 48。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
