    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to postfix:\n\n((7 − 1 * 5 + 9 / 3) ^ 2 − 7) / 3",
        "zh": "请将以下中缀表达式转换为后缀表达式:\n\n((7 − 1 * 5 + 9 / 3) ^ 2 − 7) / 3"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`715*-93/^2+7-3/`",
            "zh": "`715*-93/^2+7-3/`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`715-*93/+2^7-3/`",
            "zh": "`715-*93/+2^7-3/`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`715*-93/+2^7-3/`",
            "zh": "`715*-93/+2^7-3/`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`715*-93/+27^-3/`",
            "zh": "`715*-93/+27^-3/`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`715*-93+/2^7-3/`",
            "zh": "`715*-93+/2^7-3/`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\n((7 − 1 * 5 + 9 / 3) ^ 2 − 7) / 3 = ((7 − (1 5 *) + (9 3 /)) 2 ^ 7 −) / 3\n\n`= (7 1 5 * - 9 3 / +) 2 ^ 7 - 3 /`\n\n`= 7 1 5 * - 9 3 / + 2 ^ 7 - 3 /`",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n先将乘、除两个子式写成 `1 5 *` 和 `9 3 /`。括号内加减从左往右，得到 `7 1 5 * - 9 3 / +`。整个括号先平方，再减 7，最后除以 3，所以接上 `2 ^ 7 - 3 /`。"
      },
