      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following postfix expression to prefix:\n\n`8 4 * 5 1 / + 5 2 ^ - 2 3 * /`",
        "zh": "请将以下后缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n`8 4 * 5 1 / + 5 2 ^ - 2 3 * /`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/+-*84/51^52*23`",
            "zh": "`/+-*84/51^52*23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`-/+*84/51^52*23`",
            "zh": "`-/+*84/51^52*23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/-+*8451/^52*23`",
            "zh": "`/-+*8451/^52*23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`*/-+84/51^52*23`",
            "zh": "`*/-+84/51^52*23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/-+*84/51^52*23`",
            "zh": "`/-+*84/51^52*23`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\n`8 4 * 5 1 / + 5 2 ^ - 2 3 * /`\n\n`= (* 8 4) (/ 5 1) + (^ 5 2) - (* 2 3) /`\n\n`= (- (+ * 8 4 / 5 1) ^ 5 2) (* 2 3) /`\n\n= / − + * 8 4 / 5 1 ^ 5 2 * 2 3",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n扫描后缀式，遇到二元运算符就把栈顶两个完整表达式合成一棵子树。除法的左子树是 `- + * 8 4 / 5 1 ^ 5 2`，右子树是 `* 2 3`。把除号放在两棵子树之前，得到 `/ - + * 8 4 / 5 1 ^ 5 2 * 2 3`。"
      },
